WEBVTT

00:00:18.227 --> 00:00:23.941
Stars glitfer in the breaking dawn sky

00:00:23.941 --> 00:00:28.695
After journeying from light years away

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:34.368
Man predicts our fate and destiny

00:00:34.368 --> 00:00:37.454
But the ulfimafte destination

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:42.876
Is known only through blood, sweat, and fears

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:46.880
Stargazer! Turn! Turn! Earth!

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.800
This life that was born here

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:54.555
Live sfrong and liberare LIGHT

00:00:54.555 --> 00:00:58.559
A strong bond connects our hearts

00:00:58.559 --> 00:01:01.562
You and | who baftle side by side

00:01:01.562 --> 00:01:04.273
The dancing flames of dawn

00:01:04.273 --> 00:01:07.401
The beat that resounds fo efernity

00:01:07.401 --> 00:01:10.112
The harmony of our feelings

00:01:10.112 --> 00:01:12.781
Are flaring up... Ah

00:01:12.781 --> 00:01:16.952
Awakening that fingling POWER

00:01:16.952 --> 00:01:21.498
Shine on Destination!

00:01:32.509 --> 00:01:34.511
Hey, Bachou.

00:01:34.511 --> 00:01:37.139
What is if, Bro?

00:01:37.139 --> 00:01:38.473
Listen...

00:01:38.473 --> 00:01:42.811
You should count the number of people you're
going to be up against before you pick a fight.

00:01:42.811 --> 00:01:45.314
Sorry, | don't like math.

00:01:45.314 --> 00:01:46.982
This isn't the time to act stupid.

00:01:46.982 --> 00:01:51.028
If 1 didn't reach you in time,
you'd be in real trouble.

00:01:51.028 --> 00:01:53.697
Thank you for always doing that.

00:01:55.657 --> 00:02:00.537
If you want to become stronger,
fight people who are stronger than you.

00:02:00.537 --> 00:02:03.832
Isn't the power of the sacred beads enough?

00:02:03.832 --> 00:02:05.459
That's different.

00:02:05.459 --> 00:02:10.547
Even if you've received a sacred bead,
your true power depends on your training.

00:02:10.547 --> 00:02:14.676
It'll be all right. If things
get dangerous, | have you.

00:02:14.676 --> 00:02:17.804
You can only rely on me for the time being.

00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:20.182
What? Really?

00:02:21.350 --> 00:02:24.895
That's what | thought,
but you're still just a baby.

00:02:24.895 --> 00:02:27.064
Il watch you for a little longer.

00:02:27.064 --> 00:02:28.690
Jeez...

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:32.486
That's so horrible.
Treating me like a kid again...

00:02:35.489 --> 00:02:38.700
What's wrong, Bro?

00:02:43.413 --> 00:02:45.332
Ba... chou...

00:02:45.332 --> 00:02:47.668
Hang in there, Bro!

00:03:12.776 --> 00:03:14.361
Bro...

00:03:17.114 --> 00:03:19.032
Good morning.

00:03:19.032 --> 00:03:21.952
Umm, wait...

00:03:21.952 --> 00:03:24.538
Your clothes are dry already.

00:03:29.543 --> 00:03:31.753
Do you have a fever?

00:03:31.753 --> 00:03:37.050
You were drenched yesterday...

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:40.637
| don't know what happened, though.

00:03:40.637 --> 00:03:44.307
You should really check the weather report.

00:03:44.307 --> 00:03:45.767
0-Okay...

00:03:45.767 --> 00:03:49.479
- Oh! So this is where you were!
- Oh, Chou...

00:03:49.479 --> 00:03:53.775
Gentoku, you promised Kan
first thing this morning, right?

00:03:53.775 --> 00:03:55.610
She's pissed.

00:04:00.782 --> 00:04:02.325
Come on, we're going!

00:04:02.325 --> 00:04:05.120
Oh! Please wait, Chou!

00:04:07.414 --> 00:04:12.961
The battle between Kyosho
and Nanyo is currently in a lull.

00:04:12.961 --> 00:04:17.466
But I'm getting reports that someone
suddenly attacked Kyosho yesterday.

00:04:17.466 --> 00:04:20.510
| don't know when the fighting will begin.

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:23.972
| want all of you on full alert.

00:04:23.972 --> 00:04:26.933
Finally, we will be getting
our orders from our leader.

00:04:26.933 --> 00:04:29.019
Right this way, leader.

00:04:29.019 --> 00:04:31.980
Come on, go get them!

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:33.315
0-Okay...

00:04:33.315 --> 00:04:35.484
She's a leader?

00:04:37.778 --> 00:04:41.531
Umm, good morning, everyone.

00:04:41.531 --> 00:04:42.657
Oow...

00:04:42.657 --> 00:04:44.326
A-Are you all right?

00:04:46.661 --> 00:04:48.330
| messed up there...

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:52.501
Umm, everyone, ...

00:04:52.501 --> 00:04:53.960
I-u

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:56.463
Fellow students
of Seito Private School...

00:04:56.463 --> 00:04:59.716
Fellow students of Seito Private School...

00:04:59.716 --> 00:05:02.219
Our great ancestor saith...

00:05:02.219 --> 00:05:05.680
0-Our great ancestor saith...

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:08.975
Listen fo all points of view,
reject what is doubtful,

00:05:08.975 --> 00:05:14.731
speak cautiously about the rest,
and you will make few mistakes.

00:05:14.731 --> 00:05:17.317
Listen to all points of view... view...

00:05:17.317 --> 00:05:19.694
Reject what is doubtful...

00:05:19.694 --> 00:05:21.363
Reject what is doubtful!

00:05:21.363 --> 00:05:22.697
Oh no...

00:05:22.697 --> 00:05:26.660
Oh no... How unreliable...

00:05:31.873 --> 00:05:35.252
Whoa... You're always so popular.

00:05:35.252 --> 00:05:38.088
Please share your snacks!

00:05:38.088 --> 00:05:39.381
That aside...

00:05:39.381 --> 00:05:44.094
| was promised a draft of the
speech first thing in the morning.

00:05:44.094 --> 00:05:45.929
H-1 know!

00:05:45.929 --> 00:05:49.224
| know, but tomorrow is...

00:05:49.224 --> 00:05:51.268
No excuses! As leader...

00:05:51.268 --> 00:05:53.436
Oh?

00:05:53.436 --> 00:05:56.189
Oh! A new gummy snack that just went on sale!

00:05:56.189 --> 00:06:00.110
This is the pickled plum version
that came out last week! Amazing!

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:02.863
- | never thought I'd get to see it here.
- Who is she?

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:05.782
| see...

00:06:05.782 --> 00:06:11.288
You got caught in the rain and
collapsed when Gentoku talked to you.

00:06:11.288 --> 00:06:12.789
That's right.

00:06:12.789 --> 00:06:17.961
She was drenched. So | took her to
the lodgings and gave her a bath...

00:06:17.961 --> 00:06:22.716
| don't approve of lodging strangers.

00:06:22.716 --> 00:06:26.887
| hope you didn't go in together.

00:06:26.887 --> 00:06:28.763
Go info what?

00:06:28.763 --> 00:06:30.599
The... bath...

00:06:30.599 --> 00:06:33.977
Of course | didnf.
But | lent her my underwear.

00:06:33.977 --> 00:06:35.770
What?! Your underwear?

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:39.566
Yes... Because all her clothes were drenched.

00:06:39.566 --> 00:06:42.319
Gentoku, as leader...

00:06:42.319 --> 00:06:44.112
By the way...

00:06:44.112 --> 00:06:46.781
Who are you?

00:06:48.825 --> 00:06:53.246
I'm Mouki Bachou, a first-year
at Ryoushuu High School!

00:06:53.246 --> 00:06:55.665
- Bachou!
- Mouki

00:06:55.665 --> 00:06:57.083
Mouki Bachou...

00:06:57.083 --> 00:07:02.339
During the Three Kingdoms Era, he was
the most brutal and skilled commander.

00:07:02.339 --> 00:07:07.844
He is one of the Five Tiger Generals and
Gentoku Ryuubi called him Bachou the Splendid.

00:07:07.844 --> 00:07:11.765
A fighter who bears Bachou's
destiny has finally arrived.

00:07:11.765 --> 00:07:12.974
Hmm...

00:07:12.974 --> 00:07:16.478
Then yesterday's meeting
wasn't just a coincidence.

00:07:16.478 --> 00:07:18.271
Huh?!

00:07:18.271 --> 00:07:21.983
Could the one who attacked Kyosho yesterday...

00:07:21.983 --> 00:07:23.818
Yes, that was me.

00:07:23.818 --> 00:07:26.446
| guess you shouldn't
judge people by their looks.

00:07:26.446 --> 00:07:31.326
So who did you want to fight?

00:07:31.326 --> 00:07:33.536
Sousou.

00:07:33.536 --> 00:07:37.707
You picked a fight with the leader of Kyosho?

00:07:37.707 --> 00:07:38.792
| did.

00:07:38.792 --> 00:07:41.670
So did you see Sousou?

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:44.881
No. He wasn't in the school.

00:07:44.881 --> 00:07:47.133
Phew...

00:07:47.133 --> 00:07:51.221
But why are you after Sousou?

00:07:51.221 --> 00:07:52.681
Well...

00:07:55.684 --> 00:07:57.477
What's the matter?

00:07:57.477 --> 00:07:59.980
Chou, that's enough, don't you think?

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:01.648
What have | done?!

00:08:01.648 --> 00:08:06.194
Everyone has issues they can't talk about!

00:08:06.194 --> 00:08:08.697
| don't have any!

00:08:08.697 --> 00:08:15.704
You always sneak out in the middle
of the night to eat jumbo burgers.

00:08:15.704 --> 00:08:17.205
W-What did you say?

00:08:17.205 --> 00:08:19.874
Ekitoku, were you doing that?

00:08:19.874 --> 00:08:22.544
No, | wasn't.

00:08:22.544 --> 00:08:26.506
So that's why you were
moving slower during practice.

00:08:26.506 --> 00:08:28.758
Think about what you've done a little.

00:08:28.758 --> 00:08:32.178
Kan, this is a bit much, don't you think?

00:08:32.178 --> 00:08:34.931
Now, now... Calm down, you two.

00:08:34.931 --> 00:08:38.768
Shut up! This is your fault for
saying unnecessary things!

00:08:38.768 --> 00:08:41.438
Who said it? Was it you?!

00:08:41.438 --> 00:08:43.940
- only spoke the truth...

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:45.900
I'm saying that was unnecessary!

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:49.279
Stop that, Ekitoku. Gentoku is our leader.

00:08:49.279 --> 00:08:52.532
Our? You just want her for yourself, anyway.

00:08:52.532 --> 00:08:55.869
You don't need to say that out loud, Ekitoku.

00:09:08.798 --> 00:09:11.384
Oh... It's nothing.

00:09:11.384 --> 00:09:14.304
| was just remembering
something about the past.

00:09:18.725 --> 00:09:19.809
Umm...

00:09:19.809 --> 00:09:21.603
All right, it's decided!

00:09:21.603 --> 00:09:25.231
Miss Ryuubi... | mean,
my leader, Miss Gentoku Ryuubi!

00:09:25.231 --> 00:09:26.816
Y-Yes?

00:09:26.816 --> 00:09:29.110
Please let me stay here!

00:09:30.403 --> 00:09:34.407
| am extremely impressed by the great charisma
you have to lead such mighty warriors

00:09:34.407 --> 00:09:37.577
such as Miss Kan'u and Miss Chouhi!

00:09:37.577 --> 00:09:40.663
You are the only person
| can serve with all my heart!

00:09:40.663 --> 00:09:44.918
Hey, wait... This is so sudden...

00:09:44.918 --> 00:09:47.837
There's no need to worry. It'll be all right!

00:09:47.837 --> 00:09:54.010
Miss Kan, Miss Chou! Let's work
together to support Miss Gentoku!

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:57.764
You fool! Quit joking around!

00:09:57.764 --> 00:10:02.644
Anyway, are you saying
that you're that powerful?

00:10:02.644 --> 00:10:03.686
Yeah.

00:10:17.367 --> 00:10:19.619
Your aftacks aren't bad.

00:10:19.619 --> 00:10:22.205
Then how about... this?!

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:34.676
Hmm... | see.

00:10:34.676 --> 00:10:37.137
There we go.

00:10:39.347 --> 00:10:41.516
Please be careful.

00:10:49.816 --> 00:10:51.484
What's going on?

00:10:51.484 --> 00:10:54.863
G-Go away, you snake!

00:10:54.863 --> 00:10:57.198
Could it be that?

00:10:58.366 --> 00:11:03.746
This is pretty funny. One of the Five
Tiger Generals is afraid of snakes?

00:11:03.746 --> 00:11:06.541
A tiger is a tiger, but a silly tiger.

00:11:06.541 --> 00:11:08.168
Kan...

00:11:19.345 --> 00:11:23.933
She saved you. You should thank Kan.

00:11:23.933 --> 00:11:26.853
W-What kind of aftitude is that?

00:11:31.065 --> 00:11:33.193
Say, Bachou...

00:11:33.193 --> 00:11:37.572
If the power of the sacred beads
is what pulled us together...

00:11:37.572 --> 00:11:42.535
I'm sure there will come a fime
when we need each other's help.

00:11:43.703 --> 00:11:48.583
Just like the day that
we three made that vow...

00:11:59.594 --> 00:12:02.805
Hello? I just arrived.

00:12:02.805 --> 00:12:05.642
So how are things over there?

00:12:05.642 --> 00:12:09.479
Oh? That's impressive.
I'm itching to have a go at it.

00:12:09.479 --> 00:12:13.566
Hm? Yeah... You're right. Talk to you later.

00:12:14.817 --> 00:12:18.154
Heave ho, heave ho...

00:12:22.492 --> 00:12:24.118
What are you doing?

00:12:25.453 --> 00:12:28.331
You really helped me out.

00:12:28.331 --> 00:12:29.832
Okay...

00:12:29.832 --> 00:12:32.627
No road is long with good company.

00:12:32.627 --> 00:12:35.338
Knowing what is right, but not taking
action shows a lack of courage.

00:12:35.338 --> 00:12:38.758
But there is so much luggage
that it's too heavy to lift.

00:12:38.758 --> 00:12:44.514
They're all important things.
They're like a part of my body.

00:12:44.514 --> 00:12:46.641
| can never let them go.

00:12:46.641 --> 00:12:50.770
If that's the case, why don't you
carry them all yourself, four-eyes?!

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:53.189
I'm S o ry !

00:12:57.819 --> 00:13:00.113
This is a nice place, isn't it?

00:13:00.113 --> 00:13:03.491
The scenery is beautiful and the air tastes good.

00:13:03.491 --> 00:13:08.997
But I'm sure you've heard about how
rough the school we're headed fo is.

00:13:08.997 --> 00:13:13.835
My sis, Kan, went ahead
of us to take out the trash.

00:13:13.835 --> 00:13:18.047
Oh? Kan must really like things to be clean.

00:13:18.047 --> 00:13:21.718
You idiot! I'm talking about human trash!

00:13:21.718 --> 00:13:25.013
What about human trash?

00:13:25.013 --> 00:13:30.852
Sorry, but we're having new students enroll here.

00:13:30.852 --> 00:13:34.731
If that's the case, then we've already done that.

00:13:34.731 --> 00:13:37.734
You idiot! Why are you
giving her a straight answer?

00:13:37.734 --> 00:13:40.695
These guys are really bad news.

00:13:40.695 --> 00:13:44.532
I'm going to enroll with force! Come at me!

00:13:44.532 --> 00:13:50.330
You've got spirit, but you
probably shouldn't defy us.

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:52.165
Is that so?

00:13:52.165 --> 00:13:56.210
Hey, four-eyes! Don't leave my side!

00:13:56.210 --> 00:13:58.713
Hey... You're already captured?!

00:13:58.713 --> 00:14:00.381
I'm S o ry !

00:14:00.381 --> 00:14:02.175
Ready?

00:14:04.886 --> 00:14:08.222
Hang them up overnight so they
don't get any ideas about defying us.

00:14:08.222 --> 00:14:09.182
Okay!

00:14:09.182 --> 00:14:11.893
Please stop! There's no need for violence!

00:14:11.893 --> 00:14:15.104
Then do you want to take her place?

00:14:19.108 --> 00:14:20.610
What is this?

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:24.238
This might be good for a bonfire.

00:14:24.238 --> 00:14:25.740
Yeah.

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:28.618
P-Please stop.

00:14:28.618 --> 00:14:32.080
These must be pretty
important books to you, nerd.

00:14:33.414 --> 00:14:39.212
No matter how many books you've read,
all you can do is tremble.

00:14:39.212 --> 00:14:42.590
Those things are useless here!

00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:47.095
All you need here is the power
to rule people through fear.

00:14:52.433 --> 00:14:57.647
What's that? The thing that
she cherished... was books?

00:14:57.647 --> 00:14:58.606
Hm?

00:15:00.274 --> 00:15:03.569
You're all mistaken.

00:15:03.569 --> 00:15:05.613
You need books.

00:15:05.613 --> 00:15:08.991
If you read books and broaden your mind,

00:15:08.991 --> 00:15:14.497
there will be no point in using power
to harm people or make them obey you.

00:15:14.497 --> 00:15:18.626
You should know that
violence only leaves emptiness!

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:24.632
It can't be... That stupid
four-eyes is Gentoku...

00:15:24.632 --> 00:15:27.176
Gentoku Ryuubi!

00:15:27.176 --> 00:15:28.594
Whoa!

00:15:30.263 --> 00:15:31.472
You're...

00:15:31.472 --> 00:15:37.019
Three days ago... | finished off all
the guys who ran away, aside from you.

00:15:37.019 --> 00:15:39.522
| finally found you, Gentoku.

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:45.361
Are you Kan?

00:15:51.325 --> 00:15:52.994
D-Damn it...

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:55.496
Thank you very much.

00:15:55.496 --> 00:15:57.331
There's no need to thank me.

00:15:57.331 --> 00:16:02.170
We three met because of the
destiny carved by the sacred beads.

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:09.010
It's true. | wish you could have heard
that four-eyes... | mean, Gentoku.

00:16:15.975 --> 00:16:18.561
Even if our birthdays are different.

00:16:18.561 --> 00:16:20.188
We die on the same day.

00:16:20.188 --> 00:16:22.690
We make this vow together!

00:16:25.735 --> 00:16:28.070
That's the story.

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:32.241
Are you impressed by our bond and destiny?!

00:16:32.241 --> 00:16:35.578
What a wonderful way to meet.
| would love for that to happen to me.

00:16:35.578 --> 00:16:39.832
Right, right? We three are the greatest!

00:16:39.832 --> 00:16:43.544
Greatest? You're exaggerating.

00:16:43.544 --> 00:16:49.509
Wow... You three are all
together because of Miss Chouhi.

00:16:49.509 --> 00:16:53.721
| understand how much of a fledgling | am.

00:16:53.721 --> 00:16:56.516
It seems you understand pretty well.

00:16:56.516 --> 00:17:01.020
All right! Train here for a while. I'l look after you.

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:04.232
Really? I'm really touched!

00:17:04.232 --> 00:17:06.275
Chou...

00:17:07.902 --> 00:17:10.446
The fact that Bachou appeared...

00:17:11.697 --> 00:17:14.617
Is this a sign a new battle is coming?

00:17:18.037 --> 00:17:21.749
| can't allow Gentoku's dragon to activate again.

00:17:28.256 --> 00:17:32.969
Huh? Kou-chan, are you sleeping again?

00:17:32.969 --> 00:17:36.222
Gentoku, let's take a bath together.

00:17:36.222 --> 00:17:38.391
What is this all of a sudden?

00:17:38.391 --> 00:17:39.308
Let's go in.

00:17:39.308 --> 00:17:41.269
The sun is still up.

00:17:41.269 --> 00:17:43.563
Let's go in.

00:17:43.563 --> 00:17:49.944
But you fool around too much in
the bath, so | can't wash you properly.

00:17:49.944 --> 00:17:53.489
Koumei will wash you. Let's go in, let's go in.

00:17:53.489 --> 00:17:54.782
Hmm...

00:17:57.785 --> 00:18:01.622
Untie me! Hurry up and untie these ropes!

00:18:01.622 --> 00:18:07.503
| can't believe that brat kidnapped
our leader. What a thing to do!

00:18:07.503 --> 00:18:11.340
I'm worried about Gentoku. I'm going info town.

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:13.426
Untie me! I'm a military advisor!

00:18:13.426 --> 00:18:15.678
- Ekitoku, what are you doing fo do?
- Untie me right now!

00:18:15.678 --> 00:18:18.806
What am | going to do? Kan...

00:18:18.806 --> 00:18:23.311
| left without saying anything, so I'm sure
that Kan and the others are worried about me.

00:18:23.311 --> 00:18:26.814
What? I's boring to be with me?

00:18:26.814 --> 00:18:31.652
Huh? Umm... No... That's not true.

00:18:31.652 --> 00:18:35.281
Then hang out with me. Il go all out!

00:18:35.281 --> 00:18:37.325
Hey, look.

00:18:37.325 --> 00:18:40.786
It's Gentoku Ryuubi of Seito Private School.

00:18:40.786 --> 00:18:43.331
Where are her attendants, Kan'u and Chouhi?

00:18:43.331 --> 00:18:47.335
This is our chance. Let's call everyone here.

00:18:47.335 --> 00:18:49.378
Say... Bachou...

00:18:49.378 --> 00:18:50.630
| can't hear you!

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:54.842
| won't answer if you're going to refer
to me in such a disrespectful way!

